{"id":"401bbe09a57b89ee","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-deduction-detachment.md","title":"Deduction-Detachment Property","display":"df-deduction-detachment — Deduction-Detachment Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-deduction-detachment","aliases":["93-df-deduction-detachment"],"display":"df-deduction-detachment — Deduction-Detachment Property","depends_on":["[[93-df-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-deduction-detachment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-deduction-detachment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deduction-detachment — Deduction-Detachment Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a formula-set candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\">\\(\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to:F^2\\to F\">\\(\\to:F^2\\to F\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deduction\\text{-}detachment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\land\\to:F^2\\to F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deduction\\text{-}detachment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\land\\to:F^2\\to F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Merely having an implication connective does not force this property; it is a separately typed property of a chosen consequence relation and connective.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F","display":false},{"tex":"\\to:F^2\\to F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deduction\\text{-}detachment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\land\\to:F^2\\to F\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":996,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a33b61258cd56ac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DDT}_{93}(\\vdash,\\to;F)$ is the deduction-detachment property of [[93-df-deduction-detachment]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-deduction-detachment]]"}],"outgoing":["afd7605d365be7b6"]}